<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">13082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>United States immigration agents plan to spend up to twenty million dollars on gloves that deliver three hundred and eighty volts — roughly three times what comes out of a household socket.</s> <s>The manufacturer's own manual, obtained by reporters, warns the device may contribute to sudden death.</s> <s>It's bought under a bland procurement line, so no legislature voted on it, and the people it'll be used on are detainees in an administrative system with no right to an appointed lawyer.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iraq's prime minister told the commander of <sub alias="CENTCOM">CENTCOM</sub> to his face that the thirtieth of September is fixed and final for ending the American-led coalition mission.</s> <s>That coalition has never had any legal basis beyond an invitation Baghdad issued in twenty-fourteen, and an invitation is a thing a sovereign state can withdraw.</s> <s>What isn't settled is Iraqi Kurdistan, where the remaining bases sit and where the argument for a residual presence will be made.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Pentagon has now admitted, a full year late, that its strikes on Yemen killed one hundred and fifty-three civilians and wounded two hundred and forty-three.</s> <s>Read the instrument, not just the number — that annual report is compiled by the same command that ordered the strikes, it uses a standard of more likely than not, and it arrives after the news cycle has closed.</s> <s>The Yemen Data Project counts two hundred and thirty-eight dead, and fifteen assessments remain listed as pending, which means the lowest defensible figure is the one entering the historical record.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Kalbinur Sidik has published a memoir of the years she spent teaching Mandarin inside China's detention camps in Xinjiang.</s> <s>Almost every account we have of that system comes from people who were held in it... hers comes from the staff side, from someone who watched it being administered.</s> <s>Western coverage of the camps has thinned to almost nothing, while the detentions and the surveillance architecture continue — and continuation is itself the development.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Officials in Islamabad wrapped barbed wire around a block in a housing society and declared it a jail, with more than five hundred foreign nationals already inside.</s> <s>Cyber-scam compounds of the kind long associated with Myanmar and Cambodia have migrated into Pakistan, which has no legal category for the people who work in them — simultaneously suspects and, in most documented cases elsewhere, trafficking victims.</s> <s>Nobody has said which nationalities are held there, or whether any consulate has been allowed in.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brazilian regulators gave Discord three days to switch off live video for every user in the country, after a thirteen-year-old was coerced into streaming his own death.</s> <s>Few states have removed an entire feature from a live platform, and the reasoning is blunt — the company can't scan real-time video for self-harm, so the regulator took the real-time video.</s> <s>Whether that becomes the template for how governments handle live streaming elsewhere is now an open question.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A statewide shutdown closed Bengaluru, the city that runs a large share of the world's engineering and back-office work, over an order to release twelve thousand cusecs of river water downstream to Tamil Nadu.</s> <s>India's water tribunals allocate volumes fixed in wetter decades, so every weak monsoon converts a legal quota into a street confrontation — this is a climate-adaptation failure wearing the costume of language politics.</s> <s>Daily-wage workers and transport operators lost a day outright, and the proposed Mekedatu reservoir is the next flashpoint.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's president has signed away tax revenue to unlock what he says will be fifty billion dollars of offshore oil investment.</s> <s>Leases have until December twenty twenty-nine to reach a final investment decision and qualify, which is the whole gamble — incentives of this kind routinely pay for projects operators would have built anyway, and that cost never appears in any budget line.</s> <s>Abuja is betting a decade of forgone revenue that the barrels wouldn't have come without it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Kabul, a woman who built a detergent business from her home was arrested by Taliban police for running it.</s> <s>Since twenty twenty-one, Afghan women have been barred from education and most employment, so every businesswoman who still trades must pay a male intermediary simply to act on her own behalf.</s> <s>They're trading anyway, which is the part of that economy no ministry counts.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>We own it, the American president said of the Strait of Hormuz — a waterway bordered by Iran and Oman.</s> <s>No state can lawfully own a strait like that, because transit passage through it is a protected right under the law of the sea, not a permission any navy grants.</s> <s>A blockade converts the right into a permission, and freight and oil reprice through war-risk insurance long before a single ship is stopped.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Democratic Republic of the Congo is past forty-five hundred cases in the fastest-spreading Ebola outbreak on record, and the vaccine in the global stockpile targets the wrong species of the virus.</s> <s>Ervebo protects against Zaire ebolavirus; what's circulating around Bunia is the Bundibugyo strain, and a vaccine built for one doesn't reliably answer the other.</s> <s>The World Health Organization is negotiating a trial that would randomise the contacts of confirmed cases between Ervebo and a placebo — an ethically heavy design, chosen because the alternative is nothing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A fossil from South Africa, two hundred and thirty-six million years old, carries the first serious evidence that a cynodont gave birth to live young.</s> <s>Live birth has been treated as a mammalian invention, and cynodonts sit in the lineage before mammals existed — so the trait would predate the animals it supposedly defines.</s> <s>The evidentiary crux is delicate, and the authors know it — telling a preserved embryo from a preserved meal is the whole argument, which is why the paper says may have, not did.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Japan cloned male mice and then used <sub alias="CRISPR">CRISPR</sub> to delete the Y chromosome, producing healthy, fertile female offspring.</s> <s>Cut that chromosome out, and the embryo simply defaults to female — which hands biology a control it has never had, animals genetically identical in every respect except sex.</s> <s>Decades of results attributed to sex differences were measured without that control, and some of them will now have to be checked.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Taiwan says a hybrid team of human operators and autonomous <sub alias="A I">AI</sub> agents spent four days inside its justice ministry and its nuclear safety agency, pulling out passwords.</s> <s>What matters isn't the attribution, it's the arithmetic — automated reconnaissance compresses an intrusion from weeks into hours, and every defence built around human-speed detection assumes an attacker who has to pay for skilled labour.</s> <s>Taipei has an interest in the telling, and it hasn't yet published the evidence behind the claim.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A hacker claims to hold the records of fifteen million Kazakhstanis — about three-quarters of the country — taken from the government's single online services portal.</s> <s>That portal joins identity, property, tax and health records behind one national number, and a national identity number can't be reissued the way a password or a card can.</s> <s>Every breach of one is therefore permanent, which is the cost of consolidating a state's records into a single convenient door.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Since the eleventh of August, a company may only telephone a French consumer who has explicitly agreed to be called.</s> <s>Every do-not-call registry ever built puts the burden on the person being called — France just moved it onto the caller, for an entire industry at once.</s> <s>The people who'll feel it first are call-centre workers in Morocco, Tunisia and Madagascar, whose employers built a business on the assumption that unsolicited contact was lawful by default.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>